Subject: [PATCH] avcodec/v4l2_m2m: port upstream buffer lifetime and DRC series

Port of Nick Rogers' open FFmpeg PR25012 at df8b967717dc0119412e6a5280281ca70d8d5ce5.
Source: https://code.ffmpeg.org/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/pulls/25012
Earlier commits: c204c01a1672dafc3771fefd09c2185215ca5f76 and
 e71ecb82c91678a8b04ba41a87fcb183b8be7890.
Base: FFmpeg n9.0.2 with ffmpeg-9.0.2-preserve-start-errors.patch applied.
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later, matching the modified upstream files.

The series is not merged upstream. Host tests and third-party measurements
do not establish Uke device acceptance. Keep driver capabilities and held-frame
lifetimes independently qualified.

